# Enter service mode the way MAME's F2 does: turn SW1 on AFTER the game has
# booted. namcos1.cpp:182 - the ROM/RAM test only runs if the test switch is
# on at POWER-UP, and that test is the one blastoff is documented to fail
# with IO ERROR 64 (namcos1.cpp:226). Toggling it later skips the test and
# goes straight to the settings menu.
#
# Cab frames only advance once the download reset is released (~sim frame 136),
# and blastoff reaches attract around sim frame 611.

# 1. boot to attract with SW1 off
500

# 2. SW1 on -> settings menu, no ROM/RAM test
300 dipsw=fffe
